# Serenity's cluster tiles (WFC). Each tile: a header "tile <name> <weight>", then 6 rows of 6 characters.
#   ' ' outside (no plate)   '.' floor (plate)   '=' lane (plate, kept clear)   '#' wall   'g' gate
#   'T' turret 2x2   'G' generator 2x2   'D' depot 4x4   'F' fabricator 3x3   'R' radar 3x3   'P' pylon   'L' lamp
#   'B' a research lab 3x3 (which branch's: the district that asks for one; its tile pinned there, never chosen)
#   '+' the rest of a building's footprint (its letter at the top-left); buildings keep off the tile's edge
# Two tiles fit where their touching edges agree character by character; a wall or gate may face outside. Every tile is
# also used turned and mirrored.

